msgid "A present network device does not mean a module is inserted. RC01 has no module-detect line, so the kernel infers presence from module I2C reads; persistent read failures also show as not detected, so this cannot prove the cage is empty. Module identity, EEPROM and optical diagnostics are not read. With presence mode enabled (system.led_sfp.rc01_presence=1) the LED is off without a detected module, lit with a module but no link, and shows link and activity with link; when detection is unavailable it keeps the link/activity LED."
msgstr "网络设备存在不代表已插入模块。RC01 没有模块检测线，内核通过读取模块 I2C 推断在位；持续读取失败同样显示为未检出，因此不能据此证明笼位为空。此处不读取模块身份、EEPROM 或光学诊断。启用在位模式（system.led_sfp.rc01_presence=1）后，未检出模块时灯灭，检出模块但无链路时常亮，有链路时显示链路与活动；检测不可用时保留链路/活动灯。"

